  "script": [
    {"cue": ["title"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "小朋友们好！今天我们来学一个特别常用的单词。"},
      {"en": "people"},
      {"zh": "意思是，人们。"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["map", "show:person", "focus:person"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "要认识它，我们先从一个人开始。一个人，英语叫"},
      {"en": "person"},
      {"en": "person"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:name", "edge:name>person", "focus:name"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "每个人，都有一个属于自己的名字。名字，就是"},
      {"en": "name"},
      {"en": "What's your name?"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:person"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "一个人，是"},
      {"en": "person"},
      {"zh": "那很多很多人在一起呢？就变成了", "cue": ["show:people", "edge:person>people", "focus:people"]},
      {"en": "people"},
      {"zh": "注意哦，它不是在后面加一个 s，而是换成了一个全新的单词。"},
      {"en": "one person, many people."}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:boy", "edge:person>boy", "focus:boy"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "人有男，也有女。小男孩，是"},
      {"en": "boy"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:girl", "edge:person>girl", "focus:girl"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "小女孩，是"},
      {"en": "girl"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:young", "edge:young>boy", "edge:young>girl", "focus:young"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "男孩和女孩年纪都还小，就像刚刚发芽的小苗。年轻的、小的，英语是"},
      {"en": "young"},
      {"en": "a young boy, a young girl."}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:man", "edge:boy>man", "focus:man"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "男孩慢慢长大，就成了男人："},
      {"en": "man"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:woman", "edge:girl>woman", "focus:woman"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "女孩慢慢长大，就成了女人："},
      {"en": "woman"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["show:old", "edge:old>man", "edge:old>woman", "focus:old"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "再过很多很多年，头发白了，人就老了。老的、年老的，英语是"},
      {"en": "old"},
      {"en": "an old man, an old woman."}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:none"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "接下来看一看，当一个变成很多个的时候，这些单词会怎么变。"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:boy"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "大部分单词，只要在后面加一个 s 就可以了。"},
      {"en": "boy", "cue": ["focus:boy"]},
      {"en": "boys", "cue": ["plural:boy"]},
      {"en": "girl", "cue": ["focus:girl"]},
      {"en": "girls", "cue": ["plural:girl"]},
      {"en": "name", "cue": ["focus:name"]},
      {"en": "names", "cue": ["plural:name"]}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:man,woman"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "但是，男人和女人很特别，不加 s，而是把中间的字母 a，换成字母 e。"},
      {"en": "man", "cue": ["focus:man"]},
      {"en": "men", "cue": ["plural:man"]},
      {"en": "woman", "cue": ["focus:woman"]},
      {"en": "women", "cue": ["plural:woman"]},
      {"zh": "女人的复数，连读音也变了，要特别注意哦。"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:person,people"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "还记得吗？一个人，是"},
      {"en": "person"},
      {"zh": "很多人，就是"},
      {"en": "people"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:none"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "最后，跟着我把今天的单词再读一遍吧！"}
    ]},
    {"cue": ["focus:people"], "parts": [{"en": "people"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:person"], "parts": [{"en": "person"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:name"], "parts": [{"en": "name, names"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:boy"], "parts": [{"en": "boy, boys"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:girl"], "parts": [{"en": "girl, girls"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:young"], "parts": [{"en": "young"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:man"], "parts": [{"en": "man, men"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:woman"], "parts": [{"en": "woman, women"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:old"], "parts": [{"en": "old"}]},
    {"cue": ["focus:none", "end"], "parts": [
      {"zh": "太棒了！点一点图上的单词，还能再听一遍发音哦。"}
    ]}
